OL,3,GNEWSATalkback at 40: From the Troubles
OL,4,Ato peace to aliens and Donald Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt's 8 September 1986 - MP John Taylor
OL,7,Fis calling for unionists to return to
OL,8,FWestminster after a boycott over the
OL,9,FAnglo-Irish Agreement; an English
OL,10,Fevangelist is lashing out at "spineless
OL,11,FProtestant leaders"; and former
OL,12,FMinistry of Defence official Clive
OL,13,FPonting is talking about his book on
OL,14,Fleaking secret papers.
OL,16,FWelcome to the very first episode of
OL,17,FBBC Radio Ulster's Talkback, the
OL,18,Fstation's longest-running phone-in
OL,19,Fprogramme, which is celebrating its
OL,20,F40th birthday.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
