OL,3,GNEWSATalkback at 40: From the Troubles
OL,4,Ato peace to aliens and Donald Trump
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor four decades, the programme has
OL,7,Fbeen chronicling the latest in Northern
OL,8,FIreland and beyond, via conversation,
OL,9,Fpanel discussion and calls from the
OL,10,Fpublic.
OL,12,FNow, as it prepares to blow out 40
OL,13,Fcandles, we take a look back at how the
OL,14,Fprogramme has changed from 1986 to
OL,15,Ftoday.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
